<title>USA: Complete buys Consumer Health for $12 mln.</title>
<headline>Complete buys Consumer Health for $12 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Management Inc said on Tuesday that it purchased Consumer Health Network of Piscataway, New Jersey for $12 million which consists of $8 million in cash and 314,650 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The transaction would add about $9 to 10 million in revenue to Complete Management over the next twelve months.</p>
<p>Complete Management is a physician practice management company.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
